> SELECT COUNT(*) AS books, SUM(copies) AS copies FROM books
books | copies
------+-------
6     | 8

> SELECT author, COUNT(*) AS books FROM books GROUP BY author ORDER BY books DESC, author
author            | books
------------------+------
Octavia E. Butler | 2
Toni Morrison     | 2
Banana Yoshimoto  | 1
Chinua Achebe     | 1

